          "text": "Pelvic examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "External genitalia normal, with no ulcers or lesions. Cervix healthy and os closed; mild thin whitish discharge, no obvious pus or contact bleeding. Bimanual examination: mild cervical motion tenderness, mild uterine tenderness and mild bilateral adnexal tenderness; no masses or fullness."
